name: Throw Your Voice
theme: jungle
objective: collect
doctrine: patrol
order: 16
mechanic: a shot that lands elsewhere
brief: They go to where the round landed, not to who fired it. Put one in the far trees and walk the other way.
advice: They walk to where the round landed, not to whoever fired it. Put one in the far trees and go the other way. It works every time and I still do not know why.
tile: 16
